  "findings": [
    "BuildingA1SE registers EVENT_UNIT_DEATH, not widget death. Registration persists until callback sees absence or second hatch.",
    "Death BEFORE egg creation deals102 chaos/universal via BJ attack=true to SelectRange400. No extra56 burn in callback.",
    "Each egg is freshh0VY withAvul. At+3s KillUnit egg THEN CreateUnith0VZ THEN copygroups,userData and RemoveUnit egg.",
    "Both new bodies useh0VZ2000HP and190 mean base attack; first grantsA1SE and new unit-death event, second destroys trigger. No copied old bonuses, attack order or summon flag is specified.",
    "No egg-alive condition at expiry. Early killed retained egg still supplies identity/position; removed-handle native result unresolved.",
    "Blueflag is registered only when originalrawcodeh0WW, propagated to generic h0VZ and its eggs.",
    "Packet does not supply eggspd/weapsOn. Existing importer uses270/1 defaults, not authoritative native values. New egg has explicit unresolved-action holding adapter."
  ],
  "partialBoundaries": [
    "ANclA1SB/A1SC remain unresolved and are not marked complete by revival.",
    "Egg native movement/weapon fields missing; fixed waiting is a visible host adapter, not proved PauseUnit or native0 speed.",
    "CreateUnit native collision and player technology inheritance; same-timestamp death trigger ordering and removed handles need native execution.",
    "Canvas egg/bird shapes stand in for missing original model assets."
  ]
